  14:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c **** /*
  15:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * Availability of functions in this module is controlled by two
  16:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * feature macros:
  17:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * - MBEDTLS_MD_C enables the whole module;
  18:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * - MBEDTLS_MD_LIGHT enables only functions for hashing and accessing
  19:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * most hash metadata (everything except string names); is it
  20:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * automatically set whenever MBEDTLS_MD_C is defined.
  21:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  *
  22:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * In this file, functions from MD_LIGHT are at the top, MD_C at the end.
  23:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  *
  24:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * In the future we may want to change the contract of some functions
  25:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * (behaviour with NULL arguments) depending on whether MD_C is defined or
  26:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * only MD_LIGHT. Also, the exact scope of MD_LIGHT might vary.
  27:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  *
  28:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  * For these reasons, we're keeping MD_LIGHT internal for now.
  29:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/md.c ****  */
